{"id":"c7befd96bd551ade","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-consistent.md","title":"Consistent","display":"df-consistent — Consistent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-consistent","aliases":["92-df-consistent"],"display":"df-consistent — Consistent","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent — Consistent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistent-—-Consistent-$\\mathrm{Con}$\">df-consistent — Consistent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\land G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\land G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>的一致性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可证关系 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li>一致系统不能同时证明句子及其否定</li>\n<li>对具有爆炸律且句子集非空的经典系统，可进一步证明一致当且仅当至少有一个句子不可证；对任意抽象形式系统，这不是本定义自动给出的等价改写</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistent-—-Consistent-$\\mathrm{Con}$","text":"df-consistent — Consistent $\\mathrm{Con}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e02